Computer on the backend.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488523-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488523-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot 0.47.0 on macOS.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen an existing Bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend any message, including a short ping.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRed error appears. Failed send has clientNonce only.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488523-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488523-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Bot replies, and the send is acknowledged with a requestId.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488523-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488523-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003emacOS 26.0 (build 26A428), Apple M5, arm64\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488523-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488523-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot: \u003cstrong\u003e0.47.0\u003c/strong\u003e (sand@0.47.0, Electron 42.1.0)\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease track: desktop stable\u003cbr\u003e\nAccount slot: google-oauth2|user_01KWB9T4P6QBJQ701NPKCE0C2A\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488523-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488523-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLast successful request ID: \u003ccode\u003e626c1fa5-3e71-4640-8111-c87fc0debd49\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nConversation / agent ID: \u003ccode\u003efa729655-06cc-4a3d-a5d2-75c0783fcee2\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nSecond Bot with the same no-requestId failure: \u003ccode\u003eff301222-1f45-4c87-be9f-a83bf1ff7f84\u003c/code\u003e (failed send at 22:17:49 EDT, nonce \u003ccode\u003ec948b538-c7eb-401c-b773-7bc63af9273a\u003c/code\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFailed clientNonces after the last success:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2f459ccf-e567-441d-863d-2913492ff112 (22:01:04 EDT)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e497834dd-bb77-45f8-9ba7-135821c93eed\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ec7974aa2-f0b1-44d0-b4ab-b7031aa3aca4\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20ee53ba-377e-46c6-98a7-cd1ff7522801\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e03353099-b0e2-42a1-89f3-f39d70d4a472\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ef281e46e-ed1f-4b09-b623-a091c6ddfc55 (22:25:44 EDT)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488523-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488523-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTimezone: America/New_York (EDT)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDid not Reset / Update / reinstall / log out\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesktop app remains usable; the cloud computer is the stuck part\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlease do a server-side Agent Computer recovery; I will not click Reset unless you ask\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:52:21.012Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":13,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":66.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171304,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-47-0-bot-failed-to-respond-failed-sends-have-clientnonce-but-no-requestid-please-recover-agent-computer","display_username":"zoe Joestar","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"c